  "details": "The email address for your account is included in your output log when you log into the VRChat client using your email address for the username field. If you log in with your username, your email is not printed to the output logs. Your email should **never** be included in the output logs as it is personal identifying information that people may unwittingly disclose when sharing output logs for debugging.\nWhen you log in the line will say:\n`[VRCFlowNetworkManager] Sending token from provider vrchat as user <your account email>@gmail.com`",
